 🇮🇹 JUVENTUS INTERESTED IN GIANLUCA SCAMACCA AS POTENTIAL ATTACKING REINFORCEMENT Juventus are monitoring Atalanta striker Gianluca Scamacca, with Giovanni Carnevali, Ricky Massara and Luciano Spalletti all holding the Italian forward in high regard. The Bianconeri believe in Scamacca’s qualities and would be willing to give him the opportunity to revive his career in Turin. However, negotiating a potential deal would be far from straightforward. Atalanta are unwilling to offer any discounts, particularly to Juventus, whom they consider a direct rival in the race for European qualification. The Bergamo club would therefore be expected to maintain a firm position in any potential transfer negotiations. 𝓢𝓸𝓾𝓻𝓬𝓮— tuttosport","image":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/UGZKhBSzxhFzRykSmIJtZqx5mS2UfVBaQ--qyOCLvZVKWN5vFDmDUeK6348Wzt7Zvkp3MEpG2OXK0wThD7Lw3SdKBh6Iw9YCVNqApsmGYU2NhHpoLvqJ2j-lCW2g0jx9ejgEdjYaMLcWUm_l7Htz9k_2CV_UjMJOyLvqiAORimxK6xgTI1tEGnG6XHmuT3akWVSZcELVTBUkL7kiMmPtPPyZc7i2Dkp1_Q-3tsqCMXhVKL3LUBm8MR9TQq1-qd6rtyJxHXsbaztzjMEBuLB3GVUtctvZ92BFvngOwI_Igey75OZS_xOXe4UTVhCX29X5OEm2vtUHZ3v4RxZ-pGE6lQ.jpg","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"18041","date":"2026-11-17T15:35:39+00:00","text":"‼️ 🇺🇸 Juventus have made their position clear regarding Weston McKennie’s future: the American midfielder is not for sale, unless any substantial offers are made for him. Given the club’s financial situation, Juventus cannot afford to automatically reject every proposal, particularly for a player approaching 29 years of age next August. A sufficiently attractive offer could therefore force the Bianconeri to reconsider their stance, despite Spalletti’s desire to keep McKennie. Regarding Luciano Spalletti, McKennie is considered untouchable and remains a fundamental part of his plans. ⚪️ ⚫️ 𝓢𝓸𝓾𝓻𝓬𝓮 — tuttosport","image":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/Q62NfC7AHDmukUOs7XF4ihb_jhKvHRqdPv03uGkBTUg4nW5OI47KVLSwOmnKaPHhdoi4UlSS_EqpogaDx4vO1OJ3l7c490f2uqAGgC6XZ1B9Z8mGdUwNPPjg45pCpgPYkBHfCfFEXW18nT