anuary transfer window Alongside Alexander Sørloth, Portuguese striker Gustavo Varela remains a player to monitor closely. Monza reportedly value Varela at approximately €30–40 million, but any potential transfer would involve an important contractual condition. Monza must first notify Benfica of any offer, giving the Portuguese club five days to match the bid. If Benfica decide not to exercise that right, Monza would be free to sell Varela, with Benfica entitled to 20% of the transfer fee. 𝓢𝓸𝓾𝓻𝓬𝓮—FabrizioRomano","image":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/HtFxxICXkA1E94kIbZ4d9iya5rj3xjnfEb_5KaTLfYOkGnJ0VyBkUJlLwFMh7RL51yjjufLufJM6pQuZQlKeV6Kwt_BkTTiq_JhOZznB2I8wws7U-99s9FNHJNUJcqW7LFsqWQDmYbxulrso4uoBg0ewLFFOBXc_f1TXkSJFtk6baJceG1SR1c1lpIKFBD2gVOspfRaOG08Jz_4kVoyaCVb9M50BUXGSlFXD05SfhT1DxscA4NVQ5O4AXacTht2FSK1yjCiP6tuH50Ujabed6kdkMVWZGIF2lEj5cK2270tNLLk8xXXyi9zng68YG5qQgb5eAsVU_mWsqVV5BzDJYw.jpg","video":"","hasVideo":false}]
